      "created_at": "2024-03-16T11:15:41Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-03-16T11:15:41Z",
      "body": "The `stat.i` issue can be worked around by:\r\n\r\n```\r\n# git diff\r\ndiff --git a/Python/fileutils.c b/Python/fileutils.c\r\nindex 882d329957..b1e273d810 100644\r\n--- a/Python/fileutils.c\r\n+++ b/Python/fileutils.c\r\n@@ -1235,6 +1235,7 @@ _Py_stat_basic_info_to_stat(FILE_STAT_BASIC_INFORMATION *info,\r\n int\r\n _Py_fstat_noraise(int fd, struct _Py_stat_struct *status)\r\n {\r\n+    memset(status, 0, sizeof(*status));\r\n #ifdef MS_WINDOWS\r\n     BY_HANDLE_FILE_INFORMATION info;\r\n     FILE_BASIC_INFO basicInfo;\r\n```",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
