      "created_at": "2024-03-17T20:26:33Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-03-17T20:26:33Z",
      "body": "I ran CIFuzz for a commit from 3 weeks ago in my fork and it failed whereas the job was succeeding this time ago for PRs continuously.\r\n\r\nAccording to https://oss-fuzz-build-logs.storage.googleapis.com/index.html#cpython3, Google haven't recently had any problems building CPython with the memory sanitizer for OSS-Fuzz.\r\n\r\nSo, I believe the issue is not with CPython but with the environment created by the action.",
